/tests/host-info-card.spec.ts`\n\nContains 4 Playwright tests:\n1. Host info card displays host name, avatar, bio, and member since date\n2. Host info card displays number of listings\n3. Host info card shows placeholder avatar when host has no avatar (uses PUT `/api/users/:id` to remove avatar)\n4. Host info card displays correctly when host has no bio (uses PUT `/api/users/:id` to remove bio)\n\n### 5. Tests Documentation Entry\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md` (lines 582-598)\n\nIncludes 4 test specifications for HostInfoCard component:\n- Test: Host info card displays host name, avatar, bio, and member since date\n- Test: Host info card displays number of listings\n- Test: Host info card shows placeholder avatar when host has no avatar\n- Test: Host info card displays correctly when host has no bio\n\n### 6. Related Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyHeader.tsx`\n\nAlso references host info with a clickable button that scrolls to the host-info-card on the page. Contains a small host avatar preview in the property header.\n\n---\n\n**Absolute file paths:**\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/HostInfoCard.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/PropertyDetail.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/users.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/host-info-card.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyHeader.tsx`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a466506d888fafbd4 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 44377\ntool_uses: 31\nduration_ms: 31952</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"624c3583-9a36-4974-ba26-76d645b863d6","uuid":"2422d2b2-f8e2-4e6a-ac59-a1778f908a5b","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/AirbnbClone, find the component that renders the host info card on a property detail page. Look for:\n1. Any component with \"host\" and \"info\" or \"card\" in the name\